  "prefLabel": "Sep 403.02 Continuing Education Hour Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sep 403.02 Continuing Education Hour Requirements. Continuing education hours shall meet the following criteria:\n\n(a) Continuing education activities shall be relevant to the practice of septic system evaluations, or no credit shall be awarded. Such continuing education activities may include technical, ethical, or managerial content; and\n\n(b) Education may be earned in one of the following categories:\n\n(1) Wetlands science;\n\n(2) Safety, including dig safe;\n\n(3) Ethics;\n\n(4) Soil science;\n\n(5) Septic components, design, and installation; and\n\n(6) Septic system evaluations.\n\nSource. #12654, eff 10-31-18; ss by #14361, eff 10-26-25, EXPIRES: 10-26-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sep100-700.html"
